error[trioxide(wasm-ineligible)]: `counted` is forced into WASM but can't be compiled: assigns `calls`, which is not a local variable of the function
  --> input.ts:6:3 `calls`
      `counted` assigns `calls`, which is not a local variable of the function
  help: only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]`, plain-data objects, local control flow, arithmetic, `Math.*` and calls to other compilable functions can be compiled (docs/PLAN.md §5); remove the directive to keep it in JS
